4. _ki-gub tuku nu zi! kal_ x x ni-di 
5. szu-bat _za3 ka2 e2-gal# gar_-at* 
# Coll. George, Andrew, CUSAS 18 (2013) p. 19 ad 28' 
6. _za3 ze2 {gesz}tukul x x gub-ba_ 
